  "solution": "BODMAS table\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\n**Given : **96 * 3 * 5 * 56 * 16 * 120\n\n**Option 1. ÷, × , -, +, =** by substituting these values by BODMAS rule\n\n \n• **96 ÷ 3 **× 5 - 56 +16 = 120\n \n• **32 × 5** - 56 +16 = 120\n \n• **160** - 56 +**16** = 120\n \n• 176 - 56 = 120\n \n• **120 = 120 (LHS = RHS )**\n\nOption 2.× , ÷, +, -, =by substituting these values by BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 96 ×** 3 ÷ 5** + 56 -16 = 120\n \n• 96 × 0.6 + 56 -16 = 120\n \n• **57.6 + 56** - 16 = 120\n \n• 113.6 ≠ 120 (LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nOption 3.÷, × , +, -, =by subsituting these values by BODMAS rule\n\n \n• **96 ÷ 3 **× 5 + 56 -16 = 120\n \n• **32 × 5 **+ 56 - 16 = 120\n \n• **160 + 56** -16 = 120\n \n• 216 - 16 = 120\n \n• 200 ≠ 120( LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nOption 4. -, +, ÷, × , =by subsituting these values by BODMAS rule\n\n \n• 96 - 3 + **5 ÷ 56** × 16 = 120\n \n• 96 - 3 + **0.08 × 16 **= 120\n \n• **96** - 3 **+ 1.28 **= 120\n \n• 97.28 - 3 = 120\n \n• 94.28 ≠ 120 ( LHS ≠ RHS )\n\nHence, **\"** **÷, × , -, +, =**\"** **is the correct answer.",
